# --- render output ---------------------------------------------------------
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. A bare `scenes/` matches ANY directory
# named scenes at any depth, which silently swallowed assets/scenes/ and kept
# every generated background plate out of git.
/scenes/
render_tmp/
sfx/
final_audio.wav
*.mp4

